{"title":"林玲(一)【连续诗画】","authors":["张菽"],"dates":[{"year":1938,"month":9,"day":7}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"张菽诗"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"擎起战斗的旗，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"林玲是不为奴隶的行列里"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一个英勇的妇女；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她翻越高山峻岭，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奔上万里征程。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"满腔热血，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永远不会结冻；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她在苦难中长成，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六年羞耻的屈辱，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"已尝遍毒辣酸辛。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸石"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸石画"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}